00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.910
<i>Never gonna stop, never gonna stop</i>

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:29.040
<i>The feeling of love is happiness</i>

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:31.250
<i>You were not in pain, you were not in pain</i>

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.910
<i>Because we fall in love, there's sadness</i>

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:36.950
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.250
<i>You gonna feel so</i>

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.250
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:51.630
Chapter Five Moon

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:51.630
Damn it all to hell!

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:56.700
First I had to write out a hundred copies,

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.510
and now it's cleaning the training hall?!

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:20.110
You can't do anything
with what you've got now.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.120
Abandon your humanity
and take up the sword.

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:26.790
Get out of here right now!

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:31.950
It's easy for them to say
those things, but I...

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:37.250
Damn it!

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.520
What could that be? I thought I
just heard something really loud.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.080
Oh, welcome back, Mr. Yamanami.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:50.870
What would you like to do about breakfast?

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:55.150
Oh, no, I had it at Akesato's place.

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:58.320
So anyway, where's the boy
I've heard so much about?

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.660
Oh, if you mean the puppy that joined up,

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:02.700
he got an earful from Mr. Hijikata and...

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:10.040
Speak of the devil!

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.620
Captured!

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:14.790
What's going on?!

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:18.210
This is it, Mr. Yamanami.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:28.310
Nice to meet you. Tetsunosuke
Ichimura, I believe it was?

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:32.230
Yeah.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:34.910
I am Keisuke Yamanami.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:39.100
If you want, I don't mind if
you casually call me Sannan.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:41.990
But really...

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.370
Quite cute.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:56.460
We've never had such a cute member before.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:00.700
So, how old might you be, Tetsunosuke?

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:02.720
Ten? Eleven?

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.050
I'm fifteen.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.910
Perhaps my glasses were a little clouded.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.660
Not to worry, they are not clouded!

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.520
Anyone would think so,
no matter who it was!

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:19.370
No, no, it was wrong of me
to say that, Tetsunosuke.

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:24.700
That abacus...

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:26.540
You someone from bookkeeping?

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:28.370
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.410
How dare you speak that
way to Mr. Yamanami?!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:37.080
Well, you see, I find that
calculating is soothing somehow.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:43.050
You know, like when I'm
just boiling with rage.

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:45.260
Especially at those times.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:48.580
What're you all getting the shivers for?

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:50.250
This man is...

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.700
one of our Shinsengumi's...

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:53.730
great Vice Commanders.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.320
Vice Commander?

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.320
What?!

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:01.980
Tetsu?!

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.070
Where have you been all this time?!

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:08.240
That demonic Vice Commander took
over the place while you were gone!

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.870
Hey, hey!
Don't you get it yet?!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.200
Just apologize for your impropriety!

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:19.000
Apologize immediately!
Apologize now! Apologize fervently!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.210
Ow...

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:22.550
Now, now, Ichimura.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:27.330
Listen closely. The actions of the
Shinsengumi are decided through discussion

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:31.790
between Commander Kondo, Vice Commander
Hijikata, and Vice Commander Yamanami here!

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:38.450
Wow, I didn't know that.

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.200
"I didn't know that" doesn't cut it!

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:44.360
But I would've liked it better if
he were the only Vice Commander.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:50.500
I wouldn't mind being a page if it
was for Mr. Kondo or Mr. Yamanami.

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:53.450
What do you think you're saying?!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.830
Apologize!
Why?

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.250
It doesn't matter, just apologize!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.040
Apologize immediately! Apologize now!

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:01.120
It's okay, I don't mind.

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:05.800
Thanks to you, I've found a little courage.

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:13.370
Now then, I think it's about time
I go say hello to Mr. Kondo.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:22.480
Well then, Tetsunosuke,
Tatsunosuke, I will see you later.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:25.570
Thanks! See you around!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:36.750
That shaved about three
hundred years off my life.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:41.580
But, well, maybe what you
said worked out, Tetsu.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:45.540
I guess saying whatever you
want to say is a kid's privilege?

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:47.630
I don't want to hear that from <i>you</i>.

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:52.000
But when you think about it,
it's definitely funny.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.370
In one organization,

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:56.640
we've got a saint of a Vice Commander
and a demon of a Vice Commander.

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.660
Thus, as you can see,

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:20.080
the Shinsengumi is currently
being run by three officers.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:24.870
And what is interesting is their
former commander, Kamo Serizawa.

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:28.160
I had my men look into it, but...

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.510
Who's there?

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:32.250
I've brought tea.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:37.630
Pardon me.

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:44.660
Perhaps I have not
introduced her to you yet.

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:46.750
She is taking care of the needs
of everyone from Choshu, and...

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:48.030
No introduction is necessary.

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:52.910
A spy has no name, after all.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:56.410
Oh, my, how funny.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:59.450
Little me, with no merit whatsoever?

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.830
I'll tell you one thing.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:05.790
Don't think about trying to
erase your presence around me.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:11.510
No matter who it is, I will consider
them to be the enemy, and kill them.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.680
I will be sure to keep that in mind.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.070
Your master...

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.020
has a wonderful scent about him.

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:39.370
The scent of blood and guts.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.540
No...

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.390
Master is... Master is...

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:58.200
Damn! How do you like that?! I'm done!

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:33.390
I can't do it.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.520
You seem bored.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.580
Ayu...

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:50.700
It doesn't look like Mr. Hijikata and the others
are going to finish their talks anytime soon.

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:53.230
I don't care.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:57.900
It's not like they're going to have
anything big for me to do anyway.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.910
Then would you mind
running an errand for me?

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.910
A little change of pace for once, you know?

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:08.920
Dumplings

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.300
Higashiya

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:26.220
<i>I know it's a favor for Ayu,
but what the heck am I doing?</i>

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.370
Man...

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:34.900
I joined the Shinsengumi because
I wanted to become stronger.

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:37.320
And what I'm doing is just...

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:42.120
Oh, really! What the hell do you want?!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.580
I'm doing some thinking...

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.560
You're the girl from...

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:03.700
And a one, two...

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:04.600
Here goes!

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.390
Sure!

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:10.230
You suck!

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:12.950
Yeah, bring it back!

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:14.940
I guess you made it back safe.

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:21.530
I was worried about you
getting home okay after that.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.790
Thank you.

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:46.680
You're a member of the
Shinsengumi, right?

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.330
What?

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.680
Oh, right...

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:52.290
Because I accidentally
called out Mr. Okita's name...

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.730
Though some terrible stuff
happened because of that.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:03.450
Oh, no, it's nothing.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:07.660
Anyway, my name's Tetsunosuke
Ichimura. What about you?

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:15.580
Saya

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.330
Say, you...

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:20.570
Could it be you can't talk?

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:27.420
Sorry about that!

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:32.520
Minoki, you're good!

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.920
Oh, heck, it doesn't really matter.

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:45.450
Well, it's not that big a deal, right?

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:52.120
I see. Saya? That's a nice name.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:59.630
What? Is there something on my face?

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:03.790
Sweet red bean paste
from the bun I just bought!

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:08.540
Hey, you don't have to laugh.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.180
Come on!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.520
We're sorry!

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:22.250
Sorry!

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.570
Throw back the ball to us!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:25.700
Sure!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.580
Hey, come on.

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:39.170
Thanks a bunch!

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.160
Here goes!

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.170
There!

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:44.540
Say...

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:50.250
What kind of guy is your dad?

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:55.470
For some reason, I just suddenly
remembered something...

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:01.690
from a long, long time ago.

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:11.620
I'll show you a neat trick,
Tatsunosuke, Tetsunosuke.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:13.990
What, Father?

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:17.120
First, from the offering box,

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:20.830
you take one step, two steps, three steps.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:24.040
One step, two steps, three steps.

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:27.540
Well, you take however many
steps you want away from it,

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:29.750
then take aim at the offering box and...

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:31.700
Here goes!
Here goes!

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:32.930
Mother!

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:36.790
Father and Tetsunosuke
are playing with money!

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:40.310
Don't be stupid! Listen to what
your father has to say until the last!

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:43.910
Thus, if you shoot perfectly
into the offering box,

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:46.530
the percentage of your wish increases.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:48.860
Percentage?

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:51.660
Well, basically the chance of it happening.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:54.330
Percentage! Percentage!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:57.370
All right! Then let's give it a try!

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.060
Right!

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:20.020
One step, two steps, three steps,
four steps, five steps, six steps,

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:25.120
seven steps, eight steps,
nine steps, ten steps.

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:01.790
See, my dad was...

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:07.410
a weird person both in how
he looked and the things he said.

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:10.120
I don't know where he learned them,

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.820
but he used the words of foreigners.

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:17.290
But because he was like
that, two years ago,

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:20.830
he got killed by the guys crying
out in favor of exclusionism.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:23.580
Mom got caught in the middle of it too,

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:27.920
so that just left me and Tatsu.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:32.890
I don't really know how
it is with your family,

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:37.890
but it's okay to think we're better
off than if we were dead, right?

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:43.770
Sorry for talking about stuff like this.

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:54.860
Saya, don't tell me...

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.480
Your family too?

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:08.130
Killed

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:14.780
Say, Saya, didn't you think you
wanted to kill them right then?

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:20.830
With me, the man that killed Dad...

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:25.040
Yeah, I joined the Shinsengumi
so I could bring that guy down.

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.980
But how can I become stronger?

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:30.830
By practicing every day
in the training hall?

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:35.000
Or by using a bamboo sword and learning
how to kill from one of the others?

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.540
But... But you see...

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:49.450
I haven't even done any of that!

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:51.500
Copying text, cleaning, and pouring tea!

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.000
That's all!

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.680
One, you must not stray
from the samurai's code.

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:03.370
And I can't do it!

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:06.850
Taking lives with my own hands
just to become stronger...

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:11.770
I can't become a demon.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.410
Stay just the way you are.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.330
Don't be ridiculous!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:28.540
I joined the Shinsengumi to
avenge my mother and father!

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:30.290
And you're telling me to
just stay the way I am now?!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:33.330
Sure, I know I can't become a killer!

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:35.300
I'll even stick it out being a page!

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:39.660
But I can't just stay weak!

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:45.640
Saya?

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:55.530
Saya!

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:07.050
But I think,

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.620
if I found out who that man is,

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:13.540
and he were to appear in front of me,

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:16.030
I'd probably...

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:22.000
That's pretty much what
the Choshu are up to.

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:25.370
Yamazaki is continuing to
gather more information for us.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:28.700
We'll probably get the details
not too far off in the future.

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:31.000
Then we're done talking.

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:32.230
Wait.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:36.500
I met him. Yes, I met Tetsunosuke Ichimura.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.290
Ah, so you met him too!

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:40.660
What did you think?
Isn't he as cute as a puppy...?

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:43.030
What do you intend to do with him?

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:46.410
The anti-Shogunate faction
is becoming more active.

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:50.000
If he becomes wrapped up
in such a bloody conflict...

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:53.480
You're a smart man. You can't possibly
be unaware of what will happen.

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:57.000
Hold on a second. Right
now, he's Toshi's...

00:19:57.000 --> 00:20:00.970
Do you want to make such
a small child kill people?!

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:06.730
He will be my page forever.
That should be good enough.

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:11.890
Mr. Kondo?

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:17.410
Yeah, just as Toshi said,
he's still a page.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.450
I see. I thought for sure that...

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:24.910
In the past, Toshi would almost
certainly have given him a sword,

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:27.540
but for reasons unknown to me,

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:32.000
it seems he's absolutely against
putting a sword in Tetsunosuke's hands.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.620
I feel the same way.

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:36.860
But even so...

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:42.540
I'm thinking of giving him
a uniform and his own sword.

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:44.250
Mr. Kondo!

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:47.950
I'm talking only about giving him
a uniform and his own sword.

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.750
That doesn't mean I'm bringing
him in as an official member.

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:51.950
It amounts to the same thing!

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:53.230
It won't be compulsory.

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:56.290
He'll be the one to make the choice.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:59.150
That's cruel in its own way.

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:01.150
Do you suppose so?

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.110
I'm back!

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:10.410
I just don't see it that way.

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:21.800
<i>As I thought.</i>

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:26.200
